<h2>Reset Your Password</h2>
<p>Hi {{UserName}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password for your Famick Home Management account.</p>
<p>Click the button below to reset your password:</p>
<a href="{{ResetLink}}" class="button" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#518751;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;margin:20px 0;font-size:15px;">Reset Password</a>
<p>This link will expire in 15 minutes.</p>
<p>If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
   Your password will remain unchanged.</p>
<div class="footer" style="margin-top:30px;font-size:12px;color:#666666;">
    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
    <p>{{ResetLink}}</p>
</div>
